        "title": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Design Philosophy"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "title"
      ]
    },
    "content_0": {
      "type": "fann-editorial",
      "settings": {
        "spacing": 48,
        "background": "#161719",
        "text_color": "#E8E6E0",
        "accent": "#B29C7D"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Form has a purpose."
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>FANN starts with the relationship between the body and the garment. Proportion, panel lines and the placement of detail should contribute to a coherent design.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading",
        "text"
      ]
    },
    "content_1": {
      "type": "fann-editorial",
      "settings": {
        "spacing": 48,
        "background": "#161719",
        "text_color": "#E8E6E0",
        "accent": "#B29C7D"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Comfort is a design requirement."
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A striking silhouette is only a starting point. The development process must consider support, freedom of movement, seam feel and long-term wear before a design is ready for release.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading",
        "text"
      ]
    },
    "content_2": {
      "type": "fann-editorial",
      "settings": {
        "spacing": 48,
        "background": "#161719",
        "text_color": "#E8E6E0",
        "accent": "#B29C7D"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Identity is personal."
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The collections offer different degrees of expression. Legacy uses archetypes to explore chosen values; the everyday lines express the same philosophy with greater restraint.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading",
        "text"
      ]
    },
    "content_3": {
      "type": "fann-editorial",
      "settings": {
        "spacing": 48,
        "background": "#161719",
        "text_color": "#E8E6E0",
        "accent": "#B29C7D"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "From concept to garment."
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The current images are concept renders. Final fabrics, construction, sizing and performance details will be confirmed through product development. Any product claims will reflect the finished, verified garment.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading",
        "text"
      ]
    }
